### 4.7 Detector Effects and Their Uncertainties

Since this analysis only concerns the comparison of equivalent Au+Au and _p+p_ jets, and not absolute physical quantities (such as the parent parton energy), the relevant detector efficiencies are only those that are different between the two collision systems or between 2006 and 2007. The effects of the various detector efficiencies on the jet energy scale are taken into account in the _p+p_ HT \(\otimes\) Au+Au MB embedding. By changing the parameters used in the embedding study, it is possible to investigate the effects of several detector-related systematic uncertainties on the correspondence

